# Polar documentation

Use the official Polar docs as the source of truth: [https://polar.sh/docs/introduction](https://polar.sh/docs/introduction)

When implementing billing, checkouts, subscriptions, or Polar webhooks, fetch the relevant page as markdown rather than relying on memory.

- Page markdown: `https://polar.sh/docs/<path>.md` (or request `Accept: text/markdown`)
- Docs index: [https://polar.sh/docs/llms.txt](https://polar.sh/docs/llms.txt)

This repo’s app is Next.js (`flashycardy`). Start with:

- [Introduction](https://polar.sh/docs/introduction.md)
